Adaptation: Go implementation of two sampler correctness contracts from
deepinfer/model_executor/layers/tilelang_ops/fused_sample.py and
deepinfer/model_executor/layers/tilelang_ops/random_sampling.py: stable token-id
ordering for equal-probability top-p candidates and strict inverse-CDF selection
that never returns a zero-probability token at the zero coin boundary. Fak keeps
its existing top-k-then-top-p policy and host-side sampler architecture.
